{"id":57509,"date":"2026-08-07T10:43:57","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T09:43:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=57509"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:49:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:49:38","slug":"trail-bombeiros-voluntarios-alcoentre","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-bombeiros-voluntarios-alcoentre\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios Alcoentre 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios Alcoentre 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios Alcoentre 2026<\/strong> (Trail BVA) \u00e9 um evento desportivo e solid\u00e1rio de grande relevo no concelho de <strong>Azambuja<\/strong>, organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria de Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Alcoentre<\/strong>. Realizando-se no domingo, <strong>25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, a prova tem partida e chegada instaladas no <strong>Quartel dos Bombeiros de Alcoentre<\/strong>, reunindo praticantes de montanha e a comunidade local em apoio aos soldados da paz.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com tra\u00e7ados que percorrem os trilhos florestais, linhas de \u00e1gua e vales rurais de <strong>Alcoentre<\/strong> e freguesias lim\u00edtrofes, o evento disponibiliza o exigente <strong>Trail de 23 km<\/strong>, o acess\u00edvel <strong>Mini-Trail de 13 km<\/strong> e uma participada <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong>. Os atletas contam com cronometragem por chip eletr\u00f3nico, postos de abastecimento a cada 6 km, seguran\u00e7a assegurada pelo corpo ativo de bombeiros, brinde de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e almo\u00e7o opcional de confraterniza\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">25 de Outubro de 2026<\/span><\/l