il 13 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Setembro:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">De 1 a 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 13.50 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fora de Prazo:<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (\u00daltima Hora)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:40<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 30 de Setembro:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (30\/09\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">De 1 a 18 de Outubro:<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (18\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fora de Prazo:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (\u00daltima Hora)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida do Trail Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios Alcoentre 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Alcoentre, concelho de Azambuja.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os hor\u00e1rios de in\u00edcio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail de 23 km e o Mini-Trail de 13 km t\u00eam partida \u00e0s 09:30, enquanto a Caminhada de 10 km parte dez minutos depois, \u00e0s 09:40.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e pre\u00e7os?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">At\u00e9 30 de setembro as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 14 \u20ac (23 km), 12 \u20ac (13 km) e 10 \u20ac (Caminhada). De 1 a 18 de outubro passam para 15,50 \u20ac, 13,50 \u20ac e 11 \u20ac, respetivamente. Fora de prazo os valores s\u00e3o 18 \u20ac, 16 \u20ac e 13 \u20ac.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o apoio de abastecimentos e seguran\u00e7a ao longo do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Est\u00e3o previstos tr\u00eas pontos de abastecimento (aproximadamente aos 6 km, 12 km e 18 km) com refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio que os atletas transportem o seu pr\u00f3prio recipiente ecol\u00f3gico.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico de cronometragem para os trails, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo de acidentes pessoais e acesso a balne\u00e1rios no quartel.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios Alcoentre 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-25\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Azambuja, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Azambuja\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o local de partida do Trail Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios Alcoentre 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 25 de outubro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas instaladas no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Alcoentre, concelho de Azambuja.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis e os hor\u00e1rios de in\u00edcio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Trail de 23 km e o Mini-Trail de 13 km t\u00eam partida \u00e0s 09:30, enquanto a Caminhada de 10 km parte dez minutos depois, \u00e0s 09:40.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e pre\u00e7os?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"At\u00e9 30 de setembro as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es custam 14 \u20ac (23 km), 12 \u20ac (13 km) e 10 \u20ac (Caminhada). De 1 a 18 de outubro passam para 15,50 \u20ac, 13,50 \u20ac e 11 \u20ac, respetivamente. Fora de prazo os valores s\u00e3o 18 \u20ac, 16 \u20ac e 13 \u20ac.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o apoio de abastecimentos e seguran\u00e7a ao longo do percurso?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Est\u00e3o previstos tr\u00eas pontos de abastecimento (aproximadamente aos 6 km, 12 km e 18 km) com refor\u00e7o s\u00f3lido e l\u00edquido, sendo obrigat\u00f3rio que os atletas transportem o seu pr\u00f3prio recipiente ecol\u00f3gico.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui o kit de participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla dorsal oficial com chip eletr\u00f3nico de cronometragem para os trails, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, seguro desportivo de acidentes pessoais e acesso a balne\u00e1rios no quartel.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68605,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-57509","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-azambuja-lisboa","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalru